{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-24","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If from an even number an even number be subtracted, the remainder will be even.","book":9,"number":24,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.24","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.24/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":24,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-24@raw-ae4f1dbaf1fa9f2f","contentId":"euclid-9-24","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae4f1dbaf1fa9f2f0cf5aefc2e61f2b1df4ca51b8bccbac06e5081605c1721e7","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-24.statement","euclid-9-24.proof.1","euclid-9-24.proof.2","euclid-9-24.conclusion","euclid-9-24.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-24.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-24","revisionId":"euclid-9-24@raw-ae4f1dbaf1fa9f2f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f7a9c4594eb0c65600275e068a54f1ecf2c14d382499039d3bf9a9c71720bce","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If from an even number an even number be subtracted, the remainder will be even."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从偶数中减去偶数,则其余为偶数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-24.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-24","revisionId":"euclid-9-24@raw-ae4f1dbaf1fa9f2f","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a176e45c7b805a10945560a247d0cba31ee06dc56086c53db62baddbc4c0f07f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For from the even number AB let the even number BC be subtracted: I say that the remainder CA is even."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将BC数字从偶数AB中减去:我说其余的CA是偶数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-24.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-24","revisionId":"euclid-9-24@raw-ae4f1dbaf1fa9f2f","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6f77a720e9123d3cdf940720110b4481b0300083f7a5adf52b8e57a91be8574","citations":["euclid-7-def-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is even, it has a half part. [[VII. Def. 6](/principles/euclid-7-def-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,既然AB是平的,它有一半。 [[VII. Def. 6](/principles/euclid-7-def-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-24.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-24","revisionId":"euclid-9-24@raw-ae4f1dbaf1fa9f2f","order":3,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98b86d5766073d15305d92b88b5f35ac9bbdaf1de32e5d8d4b863d6bd54499b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason BC also has a half part; so that the remainder [CA also has a half part, and] AC is therefore even. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,BC也占一半;因此,其余[CA也占一半,AC因此是偶数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-24.source","contentId":"euclid-9-24","revisionId":"euclid-9-24@raw-ae4f1dbaf1fa9f2f","order":4,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"247a4fc2d280241b59e3e633c5fae0433c8872ffc20444683f93884af1235434","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: ht